- Version: first `##` heading of `CHANGELOG.md` (`## 0.0.1 – unreleased`).
- Last change: newest `.changes/` entry by highest task id — `.changes/P0-23-demo-anchors.md`; the
  task title comes from `board.json` / `tasks/P0-23.md`.
- Date/time: file modification time of that newest `.changes` entry, formatted `YYYY-MM-DD HH:MM` in
